<title>GERMANY: Bunds, futures market closed for Christmas holiday.</title>
<headline>Bunds, futures market closed for Christmas holiday.</headline>
<text>
<p>German debt and debt futures markets are closed Tuesday for Christmas holiday. Markets reopen on Friday. March Bund future on Monday ended trade at 100.66, up 23 basis points from Friday's close.</p>
</text>
